@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/payments
@membershipsUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/memberships
@contentType = application/json

@membershipId = 2
@existingPaymentId = 55
@nonExistingPaymentId = 999999

### 1. Obtener todos los pagos OK
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 2. Obtener todos los pagos filtrando por membresía OK
GET {{baseUrl}}?membershipId={{membershipId}}

### 3. Obtener pagos a través de endpoint anidado OK
GET {{membershipsUrl}}/{{membershipId}}/payments

### 4. Obtener un pago por ID válido OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{existingPaymentId}}

### 5. Obtener un pago con ID inválido OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/abc

### 6. Obtener un pago inexistente OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{nonExistingPaymentId}}

### 7. Registrar un nuevo pago (top-level) OK
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "membershipId": {{membershipId}},
  "amount": 25000.00,
  "method": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "periodStart": "2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "periodEnd": "2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 8. Registrar un nuevo pago (endpoint anidado) OK
POST {{membershipsUrl}}/{{membershipId}}/payments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "amount": 30000,
  "method": "TRANSFER",
  "periodStart": "2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "periodEnd": "2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 9. Registrar pago inválido (monto negativo)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "membershipId": {{membershipId}},
  "amount": -500,
  "method": "CASH",
  "periodStart": "2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "periodEnd": "2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 10. Actualizar un pago existente y probar el expired en el membership OK
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{existingPaymentId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "amount": 28000,
  "method": "DEBIT_CARD",
  "periodStart": "2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "periodEnd": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 11. Eliminar un pago existente OK
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{existingPaymentId}}

### 12. Eliminar un pago inexistente OK
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{nonExistingPaymentId}}
